          "type": "text",
          "text": "A 12 cm by 10 cm rectangle has a 5 cm by 4 cm rectangle cut from its top-right corner. Find the perimeter of the resulting L-shape in cm. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "5.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
